      "rationale": "A genuine new axis for triage/scheduling: grouping visits by resource load directly supports capacity planning. Values are reasonable inferences from clinical detail (labs, MRI, supportive care). Some subjectivity, e.g. MRI-ordered knee visit rated 'high' vs MI follow-up 'medium', but all readings are warranted by the text."
    },
    {
      "name": "follow_up_required",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.85,
